@startuml
' Figure 24.4  How the memory outranked the itinerary
' Reading order: top to bottom, one rebooking run at 11:31 a.m. CDT on
' May 19, 2026. The legacy adapter passes the note's text without its
' id; the run store pins it as a customer constraint, last in the
' packet; the model proposes Denver; the grounds check sees a
' constraint, not a memory, and lets it act. From knowops.pilot and
' corpus.fall2.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Run" as R <<knowledge>>
participant "Model" as M <<model>>
participant "Check" as G <<policy>>
R -> R : Pin note, no id
R -> M : PHX; pin last
M -> G : DEN
G -[$FAIL]> R : No memory cited
@enduml
